{"product_id":"the-adventure-of-the-christmas-pudding-poirot","title":"The Adventure of the Christmas Pudding (Poirot)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe New-Look Series Of Hercule Poirot Books For The 21St Century. First Came A Sinister Warning To Poirot Not To Eat Any Plum Pudding\u0026amp; Then The Discovery Of A Corpse In A Chest\u0026amp; Next, An Overheard Quarrel That Led To Murder\u0026amp; The Strange Case Of The Dead Man Who Altered His Eating Habits\u0026amp; And The Puzzle Of The Victim Who Dreamt His Own Suicide. What Links These Five Baffling Cases? The Little Grey Cells Of Monsieur Hercule Poirot!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 111 x 178\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Agatha Christie\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780007121083\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890753429657,"sku":"14RD9780007121083","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6915f26a951c8_81f_0pm6m7L._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1763046099","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-adventure-of-the-christmas-pudding-poirot","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}